---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import NavBar from '../components/NavBar.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Report & Request" description="Report a bug or request a feature for amber. Opens a GitHub issue form with the right template pre-selected.">
  <NavBar />
  <main>
    <h1>Report &amp; Request</h1>

    <section class="section">
      <p>
        Amber is beta and moving. Bug reports and feature requests are read, and
        they shape what gets built next. Filing one takes a minute, pick a
        track below and GitHub opens a pre-filled form.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider-thick" />

    <section class="section">
      <div class="report-grid">
        <a class="report-card" href={site.issues.newBug} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <h2>Report a bug</h2>
          <p>
            Something is broken, confusing, or behaving differently than
            described. Include steps to reproduce and your environment.
          </p>
          <span class="report-cta">open bug form →</span>
        </a>

        <a class="report-card" href={site.issues.newFeature} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <h2>Request a feature</h2>
          <p>
            An idea, an improvement, or a capability you wish amber had.
            Describe the problem it solves, not just the solution.
          </p>
          <span class="report-cta">open feature form →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="section">
      <h2>What happens next</h2>
      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>The form opens on GitHub with the matching template already selected.</li>
        <li>Required fields are enforced, so the report arrives with the details needed to act on it.</li>
        <li>Your issue is public and tracked alongside the rest of the project.</li>
        <li>A GitHub account is required to submit, browsing issues needs no account.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Before you file</h2>
      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>Search <a href={site.issues.list} rel="noopener">existing issues</a>, it may already be tracked or fixed.</li>
        <li>Check the <a href="/manual">manual</a> and <a href="/install">install guide</a> for setup problems.</li>
        <li>If you built from source, include your compiler and commit.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Prefer to send a patch instead? See the
        <a href={site.issues.contributing} rel="noopener">contributing guide</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        Amber treats model output as untrusted input and confines side effects
        by design. If you believe you have found a security issue, please
        describe it clearly and avoid publishing exploit details before it can
        be assessed.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Direct links</h2>
      <div class="terminal">
        <pre>bug      {site.issues.newBug}
feature  {site.issues.newFeature}
issues   {site.issues.list}</pre>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .report-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }

  .report-card {
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid #33260e;
    background: #0a0700;
    padding: 24px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .report-card:hover {
    border-color: #ffb000;
    background: #120c02;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 176, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .report-card h2 {
    color: #ffcf4d;
    font-size: 1.05em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 176, 0, 0.45);
  }

  .report-card p {
    color: #9a7c47;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .report-cta {
    color: #ffb000;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255, 176, 0, 0.5);
  }
</style>
